    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >27 games for the price of 1</h2>Genres included:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Platformer<br></li><li>Metroidvania<br></li><li>Shoot 'em up<br></li><li>Beat 'em up<br></li><li>Typing Game<br></li><li>Text based adventure<br></li><li>Tower Defense<br></li><li>FPS<br></li><li>Stealth<br></li><li>And more...</li></ul>The game is comprised of 9 short levels for practice and 9 long gauntlet levels for the real challenge.<br>The game tracks your Gamer score throughout the levels and calculates an assessment on your gamer skill.<br>Simple walk-through is 4-6 hours. For a completionist it is much more.",
